<title>THAILAND: National Finance unaudited 1996 net falls.</title>
<headline>National Finance unaudited 1996 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited financial results for the year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				   1996			1995</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		 4.78     vs	     6.58</p>
<p>    Net		    1,214.32     vs	 1,495.70</p>
<p>NOTE: National Finance and Securities Plc is one of Thailand's largest finance and securities firms.</p>
